{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">台積電上月收入創出單月新高。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">有4,675億新台幣，較六月增加百分之5.6，按年上升接近四成半。綜合一至七月收入，累計逾2.8萬億新台幣，按年升幅三成七。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T11:18:19.670388+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":77,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}